<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-17T00:38:26.218Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 00:38:26 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Security forces in Port-au-Prince and Kenscoff are now confronting gangs with support from a Kenya-led multinational mission, while Erik Prince has deployed Blackwater contractors using drones, air support and over 2,000 drone strikes against the gangs. The United Nations renewed sanctions on Haiti and added US$75 million for life-saving aid to 507,000 people. Bangladesh has begun pre-deploying a vanguard of soldiers, with an advance team leaving for the UN security mission in Haiti. Child gang recruits report being forced to kill under gang pressure. The conflict caused 193 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168598&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNZjZUQXVjYmZJM3FuMk01bnBGa3pyM0FQV09kY09OeHF1SUZqTGtheDZEaXE5VEViZTVULWs2M1d6QmMzVlZQVWZaX1AzbUFhVUZSXzVsXzV3UGNuQS10QXBhcnJLU2hxdVczTGdITHNwMURUdVd3N1BIM1AwUXgtd3FvaS1EVFZNSGdPTWVxOGJzUzNIZGZIbTRIZTc?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE05Q2ZEV1NJUXctZ25lX2ZsblhwSGZDSnVNYjRNcS13aTZ0ZHg3NzhKTVA0clhaLWhndE9MZW9TVEYxeTB1eGpJNjluTC05NlJLUnhuX2RTRVZSQURxM2U2dUlmcHJDbk95ajZwd3RJc3dwcnRKbGFkMC14UHA?oc=5&quot;&gt;PBS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE0wbjgzbU5lOWt0RmdtMDM2R1BkMXZia0pmeTFocVNDbFg3WWZUYjdpRVlKVVE0RWtxakdaUmdIUWxMRWVUTEl0bDBtS0dxYmN4VDNkR2dUaUFKb1FwMTNNVDhCdjVzWUN5dmJNNA?oc=5&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;PBS&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQeVlUVWxLYTV0Z1dmS2Q5UzBxV0E0YjlYZXJ5a3hXajZBdUtOZ3AzYmZjbmYybU9nSXNhSnE4dlN1U2NtX2pDR1A5QXkzUUU5dmg0MW45TXQ2ZVBESy05MmJ6X2NkeC1rN0g3NmhhVGNhX1dTdDdzWFpQMW5mdG40Ylc2SXdLY1J5eFNu